    "known_facts": "You logged request REQ-NB-1103 for the November newsletter (winter service offer and the new e-cargo bikes), which goes out through Bølgepost tomorrow at 08:00. The send list is everyone tagged 'nyhedsbrev' in the shop system: five customers, Mikkel Sørensen, Ida Kjær, Rasmus Dahl, Sofie Brandt and Signe Holm. Signe has been a regular for years (she books the winter service every November) and, as far as you know, has been on the newsletter list since the old webshop days; you do not know how or when she signed up. The list has to be uploaded today for the 08:00 send.",
